<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.56% (Discount)		     O/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  Par					T/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>		   Oct 29, 1996			Oct 28, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.39%	1 month forward =  3.41%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.92%	2 month forward =  4.61%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  5.35%	3 month forward =  6.14%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.97%	4 month forward =  6.40%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.62%	5 month forward =  6.96%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.68%	6 month forward =  6.95%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
